  "subtitle": "",
  "subtitle_en": "",
  "lead": "她帶著空手走進市場，想把每個故事都帶走。得到的越多，門卻越窄。",
  "lead_en": "She enters the market with empty hands, hoping to take every story home. The more she gathers, the narrower the doorway becomes.",
  "statement_title": "",
  "statement": "她帶著空手走進市場，想把每個故事都帶走。得到的越多，門卻越窄。\n\n後來，她把蓋子放在一旁。\n有人帶走一枚種莢，也有人留下一塊她從未見過的木片。",
  "statement_en": "She enters the market with empty hands, hoping to take every story home. The more she gathers, the narrower the doorway becomes.\n\nLater, she sets the lid aside.\nSomeone carries away a seed pod. Someone leaves a piece of wood she has never seen before.",
  "afterword": "後來，她把蓋子放在一旁。\n有人帶走一枚種莢，也有人留下一塊她從未見過的木片。",
  "afterword_en": "Later, she sets the lid aside.\nSomeone carries away a seed pod. Someone leaves a piece of wood she has never seen before.",
  "series_statement": "《神話未完成》\n史旺姬走進流傳至今的神話，留下它最核心的問題，讓它面對今天的生活。神話一直被講述、被使用，所以還沒有完成。",
  "series_statement_en": "Myths in the Making\nSwanky Ji steps into myths that are still being told, keeps the question at their heart, and lets it meet the life we live now. A myth that is still told and still used is not yet finished.",
